    Sorts an array of integers using a highly optimized algorithm.
    For large arrays (up to 10^6), this implementation uses a hybrid approach:
    - For small arrays, uses a simple insertion sort for better cache locality.
    - For larger arrays, uses a quicksort-like partitioning with a median-of-three pivot selection
